  "paper_id": "sigcomm-2025-understanding-and-profiling-cxl-mem-using-pathfinder-b0636b9c",
  "title": "Understanding and Profiling CXL.mem Using PathFinder",
  "abstract": "CXL.mem and the resulting memory pool are promising and gaining great attention. Unlike local memory, CXL DIMMs stay at the I/O subsystem, whose inferior performance can easily impact the processor pipeline and memory subsystem, yielding performance interference, hardware contention, obscure behaviors, and underutilized communication and computing resources. However, our community lacks a tool to understand and profile the CXL.mem protocol execution end-to-end between CPU and remote DIMM.",
